※ pl4g-test: compile=ok run=native,qemu exit=64 diag=none

※ The widest unsigned type, where what says the product went past is that the
※ upper half of it is not nought.  The ordinary operator stops the program
※ where the saturating one would answer with the largest value the type holds.

let big: u64 = 4294967296u64

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    if big × big = big:
        1u6
    else:
        2u6
